        "text_8y6f6T": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Behind every collection stands nearly two decades of technical apparel development through Valore's own performance manufacturing studio, where advanced materials, precise construction, and riding experience shape each product.</p><p>At the heart of the brand is a philosophy we call AOE:<br/><strong>Aspire. Overcome. Elevate.</strong><br/>To <strong>Aspire</strong> beyond yesterday.<br/>To <strong>Overcome</strong> the road ahead.<br/>To <strong>Elevate</strong> every ride.</p><p>Because cycling is never only about reaching the destination.</p><p>It is about the riders we become along the way.</p><p>VALORE<br/><br/></p>"
          }
